---
// src/pages/privacy.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Global Nexus Media"
  description="Privacy Policy for Global Nexus Media. How we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last updated: March 2026</p>

    <p>
      This Privacy Policy describes how Global Nexus Media ("we", "us", or "our")
      collects, uses, and shares information when you visit
      <strong>global-nexus-blog.pages.dev</strong> (the "Site").
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      We collect limited information automatically when you visit the Site,
      including your IP address, browser type, pages visited, and referring URLs.
      This data is collected through Cloudflare Web Analytics and is used solely
      to understand site performance. We do not collect personally identifiable
      information unless you voluntarily provide it (e.g., via email contact).
    </p>

    <h2>2. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The Site uses cookies and similar tracking technologies for analytics and
      affiliate link tracking. Specifically:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics cookies:</strong> We use Cloudflare Web Analytics,
        which is privacy-first and does not use cookies to track individuals
        across sites.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Affiliate tracking cookies:</strong> When you click an affiliate
        link on this Site, third-party affiliate networks (including Impact.com)
        may place a cookie in your browser to attribute any subsequent purchase
        to our referral. These cookies do not store personal information beyond
        what is necessary for commission tracking.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time. Disabling
      cookies will not affect your ability to read our content.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Global Nexus Media participates in affiliate marketing programs. This means
      that some links on this Site are affiliate links — if you click one and make
      a purchase, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.
    </p>
    <p>
      We are a participant in the following affiliate programs:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Semrush Affiliate Program (via Impact.com)</li>
      <li>NordVPN Affiliate Program</li>
      <li>Amazon Associates Program</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      All affiliate relationships are disclosed at the top of any article that
      contains affiliate links. Our editorial opinions are independent and are
      not influenced by affiliate relationships.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      We use the following third-party services that may collect data:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Cloudflare Pages</strong> — Site hosting. Cloudflare may log
        access data per their
        <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Privacy Policy
        </a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Impact.com</strong> — Affiliate tracking platform. See
        <a href="https://impact.com/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Impact Privacy Policy
        </a>.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to
      third parties. Information may be shared only to the extent necessary to
      operate the Site (e.g., hosting providers) or as required by law.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain analytics data in aggregate, anonymized form. We do not maintain
      individual user profiles or browsing histories.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on your location, you may have rights under applicable privacy
      laws (including GDPR for EU residents and relevant Japanese privacy law)
      to access, correct, or delete personal information we hold about you.
      To exercise these rights, contact us at the address below.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This Site is not directed at children under the age of 13. We do not
      knowingly collect personal information from children.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "Last updated"
      date at the top of this page will reflect any changes. Continued use of
      the Site after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br />
      <strong>Email:</strong> legal@globalnexus.io<br />
      <strong>Site:</strong> https://global-nexus-blog.pages.dev
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 4rem auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text, #2a2a2a);
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: #888;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-page ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .legal-page li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-page a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>